@startuml
title US10 - Register a Test Type\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6


actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

Admin -> System : requestTestTypeRegistration()
activate System
System --> Admin : requestTestTypeData()
deactivate System


Admin -> System : submitTestTypeData(internalCode, nhsCode,\ncollectionMethodDescription)
activate System
alt Internal Code does not contain exactly four digits
    System --> Admin : registrationRejected()
else NHS Code is not five alphanumeric characters
    System --> Admin : registrationRejected()
else Internal Code is already registered
    System --> Admin : registrationRejected()
else NHS Code is already registered
    System --> Admin : registrationRejected()
else Codes are valid and unique
    System --> Admin : registrationSucceeded()
end

deactivate System
note right of System
AC10-1: Internal Code has exactly four digits.
AC10-2: NHS Code has exactly five alphanumeric characters.
AC10-3: Both codes are unique among registered test types.
end note

@enduml
